      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The first crew Kelsier put together, to break into Kredik Shaw, included Mare and Redd. All but Kelsier died during the heist or after it.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "final-empire", "chapter": "3" },
                { "book": "shadows-of-self", "chapter": "11" }
              ]
